  "items": [
    {
      "file": "section-1.mp3",
      "text": "The man looks worried, and his friend seems calm. He looks like a student waiting for an important result.",
      "kind": "section",
      "bytes": 90323,
      "sha256": "580129a1ccb01df23eac06cfe9dfb217cbe3d21ffdee20f3b3ca5c2ea450d7e0"
    },
    {
      "file": "section-2.mp3",
      "text": "He must be nervous because his hands are shaking. He might be waiting for exam results, but we can't be sure.",
      "kind": "section",
      "bytes": 99936,
      "sha256": "e16ae9f439bf9c4de3b01fd05452581005821353403b28754aebf07c4915f3c7"
    },
    {
      "file": "section-3.mp3",
      "text": "I think he feels tired because the long wait is tiring. I guess he needs support. Perhaps she can cheer him up.",
      "kind": "section",
      "bytes": 107877,
      "sha256": "a4dc87c97562ebba348725dd12024a633959d3bcb5849f7f0c623da9ac44d0ef"
    },
    {
      "file": "section-4.mp3",
      "text": "She seems kind and has a heart of gold. He takes a breath to calm down, and she stays beside him.",
      "kind": "section",
      "bytes": 97010,
      "sha256": "4e8024a79ba5ccc8cc9326019b825e762870e9858bcd285b7e11e7fe7d5deee5"
    },
